 "title": "Mars' Mystery Light Rocks",
 "cat": "space",
 "emoji": "🚀",
 "sentences": [
  "Mars just revealed a field of strange, light-colored rocks.",
  "Perseverance found these boulders in a region called Lac de Charmes.",
  "The planet is usually covered in dark basalt, making these unique.",
  "Data shows they are gabbro, formed by cooling magma deep underground.",
  "Now the rover is investigating nearby breccia to see if these rocks eroded from it.",
  "Ancient asteroid impacts might explain how they reached the surface."
